<title>BELGIUM: EU sugar panel to discuss monthly refund guideline.</title>
<headline>EU sugar panel to discuss monthly refund guideline.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee will on Wednesday discuss setting an annual guideline for the monthly export refund for products which have a sugar content, an EU official said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The refund for these non-Annex II products is set monthly but it is felt that it would be useful to have a guideline for the year showing how the figures are decided each month,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The committee will also decide monthly export tenders and molasses import duties.</p>
<p>--Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
